repository-code: "https://github.com/JustinZHAO-05/HP-GSBS-SoftwareX-Reproducibility"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility materials for HP-GSBS: Accelerating greedy state boundary
  search with reusable interval statistics. Includes benchmark observations,
  synthetic examples, CC BY 4.0 Sherlock/BBBD-derived analysis inputs, figure
  sources, table regeneration and portable rerun scripts. Original code is MIT;
  data, figures and documentation are CC BY 4.0 with source attribution.
keywords:
